nd a name - The Quiet Rapture. After decades of decay and crumbling infrastructure, the Consolidation of Iron has made a discovery on a barren moon designated AT-5. An ocean of blood.\\u2028 Hoping to discover desperately needed resources they immediately launch an expedition. A submarine is crafted and a convict is welded inside. Due to the pressure and depth of the ocean the forward viewport has been encased in metal. If successful, they will earn their freedom. If not, another will follow. This will be the 13th expedition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The stars are gone. The planets have disappeared. Only those on space stations or starships were left to give the end a name. The Quiet Rapture. The universe dims.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, bloody images, threat\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-29\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":125,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017729\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\",\"0000000022\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"4187d757-ba5e-42e9-9ba3-f3aa56e6b45f\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008390\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009492\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"(New) Iron Lung Inc\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008395\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Border 2\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"During the events of the 1971 Indo-Pak war, a new generation of young Indian warriors were getting ready to defend the nation from an even bigger threat to the Indian motherland.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"During the events of the 1971 Indo-Pak war, a new generation of young Indian warriors were getting ready to defend the nation from an even bigger threat\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":199,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nvmc2ECk8Lo\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000133\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000231\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005031\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001128\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002713\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000024\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"263d0f31-f2aa-489e-b8db-f1bb8f88a009\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008395\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009497\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"AA Films UK LTD\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008400\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"En Ghab El Kot \",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Zain, a quiet art history professor, is mistaken for a famous thief known as \\\"The Cat\\\" due to their uncanny resemblance. When his fiancée Hind is assigned to restore a valuable painting that \\\"The Cat\\\" plans to steal, Zain gets caught in a whirlwind of danger and comedy. While Hind is drawn to the mysterious thief, Zain is tasked with recovering the stolen artwork — leaving her torn between the two men.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The theft of a famous painting from a museum leads to an unexpected conflict between the gang members and the museum staff.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":100,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012604\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012605\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017120\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017751\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017752\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000001