ings … then promptly forgets all about them. So who looks monstrous creations to (almost)-LIFE after the castle? Who takes care of the monsters? Who teaches them NOT to be monstrous, so the townsfolk don’t form an Angry Mob and burn the castle to the ground? Meet Stitch Head the professor’s very first creation.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Meet Stitch Head, the first of many monstrous creations of a mad professor, who’s about to break out of his castle home to find fame and fortune! \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000011\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very mild threat, rude humour, upsetting scenes, violence, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":91,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SlHrSRmobKQ\",\"displayPriority\":14,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000645\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001141\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003295\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010210\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017460\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017461\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017462\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017463\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017464\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017465\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001278\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\",\"0000000006\",\"0000000010\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"2951842e-577b-4cfb-a291-a57668c68ee0\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008241\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009335\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Kazoo Films\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008273\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Primate\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In PRIMATE, a group of friends’ tropical vacation turns into a terrifyi