Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"90e71dd1-a916-4807-8aff-0dd9f141e72d\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008101\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009187\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"ENTERTAINMENT FILM DISTRIBUTOR\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008189\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later: The Bone Temple. In a continuation of the epic story, Dr. Kelson (Ralph Fiennes) finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's (Alfie Williams) encounter with Jimmy Crystal (Jack O'Connell) becomes a nightmare he can't escape. In the world of The Bone Temple, the infected are no longer the greatest threat to survival - the inhumanity of the survivors can be stranger and more terrifying.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong gory violence, injury detail, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-14\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":109,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyYliP8dPWU\",\"displayPriority\":9,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000097\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000442\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002404\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002653\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005575\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014011\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014576\",\"ro