ly, it's a battle of wills and wits to make it out alive.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Two colleagues become stranded on a deserted island, the only survivors of a plane crash. On the island, they must overcome past grievances and work together to survive. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-05\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":113,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NwR6J0W4XN0\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005399\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008617\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009978\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000303\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001664\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001891\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"d6fe525e-3f8f-4e06-ba6b-7bcad91081ff\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008310\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009406\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008356\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Stray Kids: The dominATE Experience\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Featuring the global K-Pop sensation Stray Kids and a live performance from their record-breaking world tour, alongside exclusive behind-the-scenes footage and intimate interviews with the band, Stray Kids: The dominATE Experience is an epic concert film that gives fans both a spectacular front-row seat and unique access to their favourite band.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Featuring the global K-Pop sensation Stray Kids and a live performance from their record-breaking world tour, alongside exclusive behind-the-scenes footage.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-06\",\"runtimeInMinutes\"