in an all-animal world. The story follows Will, a small goat with big dreams who gets a once-in-a-lifetime shot to join the pros and play roarball–a high-intensity, co-ed, full-contact sport dominated by the fastest, fiercest animals in the world. Will’s new teammates aren’t thrilled about having a little goat on their roster, but Will is determined to revolutionize the sport and prove once and for all that “smalls can ball!”\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Sony Pictures Animation, the studio behind Spider-Man TM: Across the Spider-Verse and the artists that made KPop Demon Hunters, comes GOAT, an original action-comedy\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"mild violence, rude humour, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":100,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kmY-rYS7yng\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000119\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002189\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006525\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009120\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011153\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011459\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017374\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017375\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017376\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017377\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017378\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017379\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017380\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017381\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017382\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017383\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{